    {
      "id": "claim_43879ff5b3fc494baa1cdc4380f18875",
      "statement": "The http.ts module provides request() for service-node fetch (using native fetch, not apiFetch, because the service URL comes from the server and should not be re-validated), existsOr404() for check operations, and isApiError() for error type discrimination.",
